    "description": {
      "content": "REST API for the Kestra open source workflow orchestration platform. Covers\nflow definitions, executions, namespaces, triggers, key-value store, and\nnamespace files. Documented at https://kestra.io/docs/api-reference/open-source.\nThe Kestra server defaults to basic authentication and exposes the API under\nthe `/api/v1/` prefix on the configured host.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Kestra",
